  userData: '{"asset":"Original generated UI background; fictional FEB research notebook
    inspired by WWII service books. Museum photographs were used as references, not
    incorporated.","generator":"Built-in image generation","prompt":"Create a production-ready
    transparent PNG background asset for a Unity historical military notebook UI.
    Use case: historical-scene / UI texture. Straight orthographic top-down view
    of an open 1940s pocket army field notebook, expanded to landscape 16:9 proportions,
    almost perfectly rectangular symmetrical two-page spread. Dark muted olive canvas
    cloth hardcover border visible around warm ivory aged paper pages, realistic
    fine paper fibers, subtle handling wear and yellowed edges, sewn center binding/gutter
    strictly in the middle. Each page broad, flat and almost uniformly light cream
    with ample completely blank space, minimal wrinkles, restrained stains ONLY at
    outside edges. Realistic materials, soft neutral diffuse lighting, subtle natural
    depth at book edges, no perspective tilt. The open notebook fills 97 percent
    of the image, entire outline visible, transparent background outside. Absolutely
    NO text, NO letters, NO writing, NO symbols, NO logos, NO emblems, NO stamps,
    NO illustrations, NO ruled lines, NO decorative props or hands. This image will
    sit behind real editable interface text and a 3D object viewport; keep both page
    interiors smooth and highly legible. Wide landscape high-resolution asset. Dark
    olive binding, warm cream paper, understated military archival mood, not fantasy
    parchment.","references":["https://collections.museumsvictoria.com.au/items/2219628","https://museum-collection.hackney.gov.uk/object-1994-108"],"interactionReference":"https://www.ggrecon.com/guides/resident-evil-4-remake-old-wayshrine-key/"}'
